00:49:47,930 --> 00:49:54,290
♪We make a wish toward rainbow's end♪

503
00:49:55,610 --> 00:50:01,360
♪Chase the dream beyond the bend♪

504
00:50:02,610 --> 00:50:09,140
♪Though this hope
can never reach the ground♪

505
00:50:09,330 --> 00:50:14,900
♪You painted hues in my barren land♪

506
00:50:44,970 --> 00:50:49,550
♪Wish stays locked inside my heart♪

507
00:50:52,190 --> 00:50:57,540
♪Colored memories never depart♪

508
00:50:59,490 --> 00:51:04,740
♪Love that's doomed yet stole my heart♪

